1
00:00:03,040 --> 00:00:06,980
A few years had passed since we had
returned to our home village

2
00:00:06,980 --> 00:00:08,520
after our long journey.

3
00:00:08,780 --> 00:00:12,440
I, Bjarni, son of Leif, was there when we
discovered

4
00:00:12,440 --> 00:00:14,580
a strange new world in the west

5
00:00:14,580 --> 00:00:17,240
and made friends with the red-skinned
natives.

6
00:00:17,540 --> 00:00:20,280
Life in our small village on the coast of
Greenland

7
00:00:20,280 --> 00:00:23,200
had been quiet and peaceful ever since our
return,

8
00:00:23,480 --> 00:00:26,040
until that memorable day in May

9
00:00:26,040 --> 00:00:29,140
when fate once again put me to the test.
